{"id":83,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"国際理解と多文化共生を育む中等教育","feature_description":"兵庫県立芦屋国際中等教育学校は、国際理解と多文化共生を重視する中等教育学校です。多様な背景を持つ生徒が共に学ぶ環境の中で、語学力、表現力、協働する力を育てます。6年間を通じて、異なる価値観を尊重しながら自分の考えを発信し、国際社会に関わる姿勢を養います。公式サイトの紹介内容をもとに、教育方針や学校生活を整理してまとめています。","clubs":[{"id":1444,"name":"カヌー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1445,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1446,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1447,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1448,"name":"ソフトボール(女子のみ)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1449,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1450,"name":"バドミントン(女子のみ)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1451,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1452,"name":"コーラス","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1453,"name":"吹奏楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1454,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1455,"name":"邦楽","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo-c.ed.jp/~ashiyai-ss/aiss4.html","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":1456,"name":"ESS","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.hyogo